tr.td:
As follows:
(a) if this Act receives the Royal Assent before 1 January 2017—1 January 2017;
(b) if this Act receives the Royal Assent on or after 1 January 2017—the first 1 January or 1 July to occur after the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.

As follows:
(a) if this Act receives the Royal Assent before 1 January 2018—1 January 2018;
(b) if this Act receives the Royal Assent on or after 1 January 2018—the first 1 January or 1 July to occur after the day this Act receives the Royal Assent.
